  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**(Second number + 1) × 2 = First number**\n\nGiven: 40 : 19 ⇒ (19 + 1) × 2 = 20 × 2 = 40\n\nLet's check options now:\n\n**1) 28 : 13** ⇒ (13 + 1) × 2 = 14 × 2 = **28**\n\n2) 20 : 11 ⇒ (11 + 1) × 2 = 12 × 2 = 24 ≠ 20\n\n3) 34 : 17 ⇒ (17 + 1) × 2 = 18 × 2 = 36 ≠ 34\n\n4) 46 : 23 ⇒ (23 + 1) × 2 = 24 × 2 = 48 ≠ 46\n\nHence, **option 1)** is the correct answer.",
